{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12226620","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12226620","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"narration:2:1222662001:0":{"text":"몇 시간 뒤, 루카에게 보고하기 위해 베인이 돌아왔다","source_cn":"数小时后，瓦因匆匆归来，向卢卡汇报——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCEAC003D873D7E17","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1222662002:0":{"text":"나리안을 미행하면서 아주 많은 정보를 알아냈습니다! 간단하게 말씀드리겠습니다.","source_cn":"跟踪纳莉安的这一路有了大收获！各位，我长话短说。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2833833EA4D52451","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1222662003:0":{"text":"저희가 그녀를 보내준 뒤, 그녀는 집으로 가지 않고 여기저기 돌아다니며 상인들과 접촉했습니다.","source_cn":"我们放走她后，她没有回家，又去到处瞎转悠，接触那些贩子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x66873FD744993494","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1222662004:0":{"text":"네? 그녀가 정말 나쁜 사람이었던 건가요?","source_cn":"哎？所以她真的是坏人啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x49EE9213860625ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1222662005:0":{"text":"우선 제 말을 끝까지 들어보세요.","source_cn":"别心急啊，听我说完。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A69554DE4BD7DAD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1222662006:0":{"text":"처음에는 아무도 그녀에게 배를 팔지 않았는데 붉은 닻이 소문을 내자 그레이 텅이 직접 그녀를 찾아가 그녀에게 배를 한 척 팔았지 뭡니까!","source_cn":"一开始没人卖她船，但等红锚传了消息，我看灰舌亲自去找她...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB0A3665A93749814","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1222662007:0":{"text":"거래가 확정되자, 그녀는 마치 누군가를 따돌리기라도 하려는 듯, 일부러 성 안을 몇 바퀴 돌았는데, 그래도 저를 따돌릴 수는 없었습니다!","source_cn":"等交易定下来，她故意在城里兜了几圈，像是要甩掉跟踪者—...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x01973398CE9AB33C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1222662008:1":{"text":"그런 다음... 스몰워터 마을로 가더라고요!","source_cn":"接着，她去了小水村！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E103770EE22DE4B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1222662009:0":{"text":"스몰워터 마을이요?! 그곳은 신밧드의 집이잖아요. 어째서 그곳으로 간 거죠?","source_cn":"小水村！那是辛巴达的家，她去那里干什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5BEBC9D130E5941F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1222662010:0":{"text":"그리고 아무도 살지 않는 낡은 집으로 들어가길래, 제가 창가에 엎드려서 보니 그 집에 그레이브본이 숨어있는 것 아니겠습니까!","source_cn":"她进了一间没人住的破屋子，我趴在窗口，看见那屋子里竟然...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5FFC04059E1AE3DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1222662011:0":{"text":"그 그레이브본은 지명 수배에 그려진 것과 똑같은 모습을 하고 있었습니다!","source_cn":"那亡灵跟通缉令上长得一模一样！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x21DA967B0DF37F2D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1222662012:0":{"text":"그리고 그들의 대화를 들었지요...","source_cn":"然后，我听到了她们的对话……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8BE6BA63314D8CC9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1222662013:0":{"text":"배는 구했어요, 그들이 러스트 항을 떠날 수 있도록 도와줄 겁니다. 하지만 최종 목적지까지는 힘들 것 같아요.","source_cn":"已经找到船了，他们可以送您离开锈锚港，但恐怕没法直接抵...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2932B2A25C768C0D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1222662014:0":{"text":"괜찮아. 나도 곧바로 돌아갈 생각은 없었으니까.","source_cn":"可以，我也没打算直接回去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D5A399642389151","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1222662015:0":{"text":"그럼 오늘 밤에 저와 함께 스몰워터 항의 나루터로 가시죠. 그때가 되면 바로 배에 타세요. 만약 무슨 일이 생기면 제가 했다고 하면 되니까요!","source_cn":"那今晚得去小水湾的渡口，我陪着您。到时您直接上船，万一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B183F53E015D00E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1222662016:1":{"text":"...이런 것들까지 감당할 필욘 없어.","source_cn":"……你没必要承担这些。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x68675305925F0178","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1222662017:1":{"text":"난 블러디 로즈의 적이자 그레이브본이지만 넌 그저 평범한 사람이니...","source_cn":"我是血薇帮的敌人，还是亡灵。而你只是个普通人……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x07466626800CCC88","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1222662018:1":{"text":"그런 말씀 마세요!","source_cn":"您千万别这么说！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC55869D1BD1E638","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1222662019:1":{"text":"만약 당신이 절 구하지 않았더라면 도박꾼인 남동생이 돈 때문에 절 죽였을 테니까요!","source_cn":"如果不是您救了我，我弟弟那个赌鬼早为了钱，把我弄死了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEEB233776EBA4BB6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1222662020:1":{"text":"이런 사소한 일로 제 목숨을 구해주신 은혜를 어떻게 갚을 수 있겠어요!","source_cn":"我为您做的这点小事，根本不足以报答您的救命之恩！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x38B92808BDCDA97E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1222662021:1":{"text":"...나리안 ...고마워.","source_cn":"……纳莉安……谢谢你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE3E8AC3B087E7864","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1222662022:0":{"text":"고마워하실 것 없어요... 그저 당신 곁을 떠나야 한다고 생각하니 아쉬울 따름이에요...","source_cn":"您无需感谢……只是，我想到要离开您，真的有些舍不得……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD40E7CBBBB72CBB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1222662023:1":{"text":"...! \n거기 누구냐!","source_cn":"……！\\n谁在外面！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x57DEFD05F88310EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1222662024:1":{"text":"...경위는 이렇습니다. 제가 실수로 아래쪽 벽을 스친 것뿐인데 그녀가 바로 도끼눈을 하고선 쳐다보더군요!","source_cn":"——事情的经过就是这样。我只是不小心擦了下墙边，她立刻...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF068D8E8B20DB0A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1222662025:1":{"text":"그렇게 예리한 사람은 정말 처음 봅니다... 다행히 그때 쥐 한 마리가 벽을 따라 지나간 덕에 발각되지 않았지만요...","source_cn":"我从没见过那么敏锐的人……幸好当时有只老鼠贴着墙根溜过...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F57CBCE8D389D15","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1222662026:1":{"text":"부두목, 이게 다입니다!","source_cn":"二当家，就这些了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25E12E671BB3FBC7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1222662027:1":{"text":"고생했군! 아주 잘했어. 정말 중요한 정보야!","source_cn":"辛苦了！你做得非常好，这可是重大情报！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF6EAA710772CD5E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1222662028:1":{"text":"그들이 오늘 밤 바로 움직인다고 하니, 지금 바로 소니아를 찾아가 대책을 의논하도록 하시죠.","source_cn":"既然她们今晚就要行动，我们现在就去找索尼娅商量对策。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD580CFF85DD2A6AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:黑屏字幕":{"text":"블랙 스크린 자막","source":"黑屏字幕","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:探子瓦因":{"text":"베인","source":"探子瓦因","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:纳莉安":{"text":"나리안","source":"纳莉安","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:冷漠的亡灵少女":{"text":"그레이브본 소녀","source":"冷漠的亡灵少女","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:卢卡":{"text":"루카","source":"卢卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":29,"localized_text_count":28,"speaker_count":6}}